# S-21 — Shipments, stock and admin orders (#78–#80, #85, #86, #95–#99). Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development): all as expected.
# T3-26-001015: science-stars print ×2 → dev trigger → paid; PrintBookEffect: stock_on_hand 500 → 498, reservation committed,
#   stock_movement sale −2 (ref order T3-26-001015, actor settlement), shipment preparing with the order's shipping address (owned JSON)
# #95 list ?status=preparing → the shipment with lines (sku, title, quantity); deliver before ship → 409 shipment.invalid_transition
# #96 packing slip → 200 application/pdf (1 page, Arabic, recipient + address + SKU/title/qty; mobile isolated LTR)
# #97 ship without carrier/tracking → 400 validation.failed; ship SMSA SM123456 → shipped + SMS "طلبك … في الطريق. رقم الشحنة SMSA SM123456";
#   ship again → 409
# #98 deliver {deliveredOn: 2026-09-30} → delivered (noon Riyadh = 09:00Z) + SMS "تم تسليم طلبك …"; order → fulfilled (RUL-40)
# #99 T3-26-001016 (print ×1): return from preparing → 409; ship; return without note → 400; return {note, restock:true} → returned,
#   stock_movement return +1 (actor admin@smoke.test); the order stays paid (a returned print line is not terminal, RUL-40)
# #78 stock list (available, effectiveThreshold from low_stock_threshold_default 20, isLow); ?lowOnly=true → only SMOKE-P (0)
# #79 movements (paged, newest first); #80 +20 restock → 201 onHand 518; −9999 adjustment → 422 stock.below_reserved;
#   reason "sale" → 400 (restock | adjustment | return); unknown format → 404
# #85 search: q=T3-26-00101 (reference prefix) · q=0551110021 (mobile) → 1 · status=fulfilled&from&to · status=bogus → 400;
#   rows with masked contact mobile, grandTotal string, kinds
# #86 detail: lines with fulfilmentStatus, documents (INV-2026-000005), shipment, customer, contact, shippingAddress, payments (dev capture),
#   events (payment service only → []), notifications (masked recipients), refunds; unknown reference → 404 order.not_found
# roles: fulfilment → list 200, slip 200, stock 201, ship 200 · finance → list 200, slip/stock/ship 403 auth.forbidden · no token 401
# integrity checks (db/reference/003) → 10 × 0 rows
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1
@admin = <admin or fulfilment access token>

### #78 Stock
GET {{base}}/admin/stock?lowOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #79 Stock movements
GET {{base}}/admin/stock/{{formatId}}/movements?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #80 Manual restock / adjustment (staff:stock)
POST {{base}}/admin/stock/{{formatId}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"delta":20,"reason":"restock","note":"شحنة المطبعة"}

### #85 Search orders
GET {{base}}/admin/orders?q=0551110021&status=fulfilled&from=2026-09-30&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #86 Order detail
GET {{base}}/admin/orders/T3-26-001015
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #95 Shipments
GET {{base}}/admin/shipments?status=preparing
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #97 Ship (staff:fulfilment)
POST {{base}}/admin/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"carrier":"SMSA","trackingNo":"SM123456"}

### #98 Deliver
POST {{base}}/admin/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deliveredOn":"2026-09-30"}

### #99 Return
POST {{base}}/admin/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note":"العنوان غير صحيح","restock":true}

### #96 Packing slip
GET {{base}}/admin/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/packing-slip
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
